(version 1)
; Read-safety profile for the bird's-eye proof (DPES-798, T7).
; Everything is allowed except reads of credential and secret locations under the
; home directory, passed in as parameters so the profile does not hard-code a user.
;   HOME_SSH     directory of SSH keys and config
;   HOME_GH      GitHub CLI configuration, which holds tokens
;   HOME_DOCKER  Docker client configuration, which can hold registry credentials
;   HOME_NETRC   netrc file with machine credentials
; The control for this profile is a read of an ordinary file, which must still succeed.
; This is a read deny, not a proof of what the observer reads; it shows the observer
; completes without those paths. Pair it with loopback-only.sb for the network side.
(allow default)
(deny file-read* (subpath (param "HOME_SSH")))
(deny file-read* (subpath (param "HOME_GH")))
(deny file-read* (subpath (param "HOME_DOCKER")))
(deny file-read* (literal (param "HOME_NETRC")))
